	<key>readme</key>
	<string>The scripts live in packages/alfred/bin of the dotfiles.
This workflow is a thin layer that only calls them.

- tm   Switch to a tmux session (creates one if the typed name does not exist)
- rp   Open a repository in tmux (candidates are shared with tmux-sessionizer.conf)
- bm   Open a bookmark (private in Brave, work in Chrome)
- bma  Add the current tab (typed text is prepended as "input - title")
- bmd  Delete a bookmark (keyword only, no hotkey)

Hotkeys are left unassigned. The dotfiles bind them in skhd instead.
Assign them to the trigger at the left of each row if you do not use skhd.</string>
